# ── LLM provider API keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to ".env.local" (git-ignored) and fill in the provider(s) you use.
# The server tries providers in this order: Gemini, Cerebras, Groq, OpenRouter.
# You only need one — the first configured provider wins.
#
# These are read at runtime by the server (server.ts) and the Netlify functions.
# Never prefix an LLM key with VITE_: that would bake it into the public client bundle.

# Groq — https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=
# Optional model override (default: llama-3.3-70b-versatile)
# GROQ_MODEL=

# OpenRouter — https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# Optional model override (default: google/gemini-2.0-flash-exp:free)
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=

# Google AI Studio / Gemini — https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEYS=key1,key2

# Cerebras — https://cloud.cerebras.ai/
# CEREBRAS_API_KEY=
# CEREBRAS_MODEL=gpt-oss-120b
